#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:54
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This handbook describes how to use &kjots;, a small program which is handy "
"for keeping and organizing miscellaneous notes."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: keyword
#: index.docbook:59
#, no-c-format
